<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Mbunga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Watesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lihamba lya mtumbulo lya Paulo kwa Watesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc2">1Watesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Wat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lihamba lya mtumbulo lya Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Watesalonike</para>
  <para style="iot">Ulongulelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Lihamba lya mtumbulo kwa Watesalonike iyandikilwi na mndumindumi Paulo 1:1 na inguwesekana ni lihamba lya mtumbulo ivile Paulo ayandikilili na kuwela mahala gha Bibilia na iyandikililwi kumachuva gha 51 badili gha kuwelekwa kwa Kilisito. Paulo awelili ku Kolinto paayandika lihamba hai kwa lipinga wawela ku Tesalonike wamkwinila Kilisito lipinga hali alitumbulisili kumwanja ghaki gha ivili gha kutangasa Habali gha Yesu hai inguhuma ku Matendu gha Wandumindumi Sula gha 17:1-10. Kihitabu kya Matendu kingulongela yiwa Lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito litumbulisilwi na Wayahudi mayaghani na Wagiliki watangala.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo kawesa ng'ogha kuhighala ku Tesaloniki badili gha kuyomola kutumbulisa lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito hali hinu kuulongolo ayeghili lihamba hai kuwataya moyu wala wamkwinila Kilisito. lihamba hai imema mavulo ghatangala na inguvula milando itangala gha pamonga ilongela vila Wakilisito wangupalwa kulikala. Paulo alongelelili nesu Habali zya kuhika kwa Kilisito. inguwoneka wayitikila wa lipinga lya ku Tesalonike wahekeleliswi nesu na mavulo hagha. Paulo atumilili Habali zya kuhuya kwa Yesu kuwataya moyu walikali ngalilu gha kumtundamila Sapanga. Hai inguhuma ku Sula gha 5:6-8.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gha mghati</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo angutumbula lihamba hai kwa kuwajambusa lipinga lya kumkwinila Kilisito na kumshukwile Sapanga kwaikiva gha weni hai inguhuma ku Sula gha 1.</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo angulongela Habali gha mighalu ghaki na Habali amyeghilili Timoseo hai inguhuma ku Sula 2-3.</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo anguwalaghila wakilisito vila wangupalwa kulikala kunu wakimanya yiwa Yesu atehika kangi. Hai inguwoneka ku Sula gha 4:1-5:15.</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo anguyomola kwa kuwajambusa kangi na kuwaluwa nesu kila mmonga ahighilisi anguisoma lihamba hai. Hai inguwoneka ku Sula gha 5:16-28.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Nenga Paulo, na Silivano na Timoseo, tunguwayandikila lihamba hai mwenga lipinga lya wandu wamkwilikiha Kilisito haku Tesalonike, wavile wandu ghaki Tati Sapanga na wa Bambu Yesu Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Tunguwatakila manemu na luheku.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngalilu na kukwinila kwa Watesalonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Tungumshukwile Sapanga machuwa yayendelela kwaikiva gha mwenga wogha na kuwakumbwiki machuwa yayendelela kumayupo tunguyupa. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Twenga tungukumbwiki machuwa yayendelela lihengu lya mwenga lya ukwinila kuulongolo gha Sapanga yula avile Tati wa twenga, vila upalo wa mwenga unguwawesesa kughola lihengu kwa kuyangala na vila mnguhihilisa ukwinila wa mwenga kwa Bambu Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Walongo, tungumanya yiwa Sapanga anguwapala na yiwa kawahaghula muweli wandu ghaki, <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />kwaikiva patuwelili tunguwatangasila Habali Maha iwelili ng'ogha kwa milando weka ghaki, ila kwa makakala na kwa Mpumulo wa Sapanga, tukiwela na uhighiliso yiwa ujumbi hau ni wa chakaka. Mngumanya vila tulikalili pamonga na mwenga kwaikiva gha mwenga. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Mwenga mkovekelili mlandano wa twenga na Bambu, pamonga na maghaso hyogha ila mpokelili ujumbi hula kwa luheku luhuma ku Mpumulo wa Sapanga. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Hinu mwenga muwela mlandano maha kwa wakwinila wogha wa ku Makedonia na Akaya. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Kwaikiva gha kutangasa kwa mwenga lilando lya Bambu Sapanga liyoghanika ng'ogha haku ku Makedunia na Akaya weka ghaki, ila ukwinila wa mwenga umanyika kumahala kogha hata tupalwa ng'ogha kulongela kangi kuilongela nesu. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Wandu hagha wa kila mahala wangulongela vila mtupokela na vila mleka kutundamila ling'omung'omu na kumuhuyila Sapanga avile mkomu na chakaka, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />hinaa mungumlindila Mwana ghaki ahuluki kuhuma kundumba, na mweni ni Yesu, yula avile Sapanga amuhindulili kuhuma kukihu na ndiwa yula angutulokola na lilaka lya Sapanga lula lunguhika.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Lihengu lya Paulo haku Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Walongo wa twenga, mwengabaha mngumanya yiwa kuhika kwa twenga kuwelili ng'ogha kwa yaghi yaghi. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Mngumanya vila tuhakilwa na kulighwa haku kummbwani wa Filipi yambila gha kuhika ku Tesalonike. Pamonga na yiwa kuwelili na mngingamo utangala, Sapanga wa twenga atupeghili makakala gha kuwatangasila Habali ghaki Maha. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Kwaikiva mghalu tunguukasila kwa mwenga ng'ogha mghalu uhumila na uhwangi, na lukani lihakata hata kuwatindila kwa milando, <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />ila twenga tungutangasa handa vila aipalili mweni Sapanga kwaikiva mweni katukwinila, akatupegha hai Habali Maha. Na hai ng'ogha lukani lwa twenga kuwahekelesa wandu, ila tungupala kumuhekelesa Sapanga mweni kumanya mioyu gha twenga mbaka mghati. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Kwaikiva mwenga maweni mngumanya yiwa twenga tutumila ng'ogha milando gha kugubika gubika uchakaka kwa mwenga hata milando gha ukalamuki gha kuhigha, Sapanga mweni angulola. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Twenga tuhakula ng'ogha kutundamilwa kuhuma kwa wandu hata kuhuma kwa mwenga baha, hata kuhuma kwa mundu yoyosi, <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />pamonga na twenga tuwelili wandumindumi wa Kilisito, tungaliwesa kupala chochosi kuhuma kwa mwenga, ila twenga tukawela wanyalinyali paghati gha mwenga handa nyongu kanguwavika maha wanachali ghaki. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Tuwapalili nesu mbaka tuhekelela kwa pamonga na mwenga, ng'ogha kwa kuwatangasila Habali Maha gha Sapanga weka ghaki, ila hata kuwatanga mwenga kwaikiva muwelili wapalwa wa twenga. <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Walongo, mwenga mngukumbwike vila tugholili lihengu kwa kuyangala. Patuwayeghela Habali Maha gha Sapanga tugholili lihengu pamuhi na uhiku ili tukotoho kuwela mhigu kwa mundu yoyosi paghati mwa mwenga. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Mwenga maweni ni wandu wailolile kwa mihu, pamonga na Sapanga, ndyangilu gha twenga paghati gha mwenga mngukwinila iwelili gha maha, na ulungwana na iwela ng'ogha na kulalamikilwa. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Kwaikiva mngumanya yiwa twenga tuwagholelili kila mmonga wa mwenga handa vila tati anguwagholela wana ghaki mweni. <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />Tuwatayili moyu na kuwalongela myangalayi, ili muwese kulama vila angupala Sapanga yula kanguwakema mkongine kuunkosi na ukwilikihi ghaki. <verse eid="1TH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Kwaikiva gha nagha twenga hilahila tungumshukwile Sapanga machuwa hyogha, kwaikiva, pampokela lila lilando lya ujumbi wa Sapanga lila mliyoghanila kuhuma kwa twenga, mpokela ng'ogha handa lilando lya wandu, ila handa lilando lya Sapanga, na chakaka ni lilando lya Sapanga, kwaikiva ujumbi wa Sapanga angughola lihengu mghati gha mwenga mkwinila. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Walongo, mwenga mhikwa na mighalu hilahila iwapatili mapinga gha wandu wamkwinila Kilisito kula Uyahudi wavile ni wa Kilisito Yesu. Mwenga muhakililwi na wandu wa mlima wa mwenga handa weni wahakililwi na Wayahudi wayao, <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />wala wamkomili Bambu Yesu na walota wa Sapanga, wakatuhakili na twenga kangi. Wandu hagha wangumhyomelesa Sapanga, kangi ni wahakata wa kila mundu, <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />kwaikiva wangutukingama tukotoho kulongela na wandu wavile ng'ogha Wayahudi ujumbi hula utewayeghela kulokoka. Havi ndiwa wamemesa sambi zyao wazigholili machuwa hyogha ila hinaa lilaka lya Sapanga linguwahikila.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhujulu lwa Paulo kuwatyangila kangi Watesalonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Walongu, kulekana kwa twenga na mwenga kuwelili kwa lipindi hela, kangi kulekana haku kuwelili kwa higha hela na ng'ogha kwa mpumulo. Machuwa mayaghani kuulongolo, tupatilwi na luhujulu ngulu lya kuwalola kangi. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Kwa nagha tulamula kuwatyangila kangi. Nesu nesu nenga Paulo, niyesili kuhika kwa mwenga miyanja itangala, ila Lihyukana litungingamili. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Ghuli, patutegholoka kuulongolo gha Bambu Yesu Kilisito pahika, lukani lwa kuidumbila kwa twenga lutevile liki? Itewela ni mwenga mwaweni, kwa chakaka mwenga ndiwa litumaini lya twenga na luheku lwa twenga. <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Chakaka, mwenga maweni ndiwa ukwilikihi wa twenga na luheku lwa twenga.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Kwa nagha patusindwa kuyendelela kufumilila, tulamulili kuhighala kummbwani Asene weka yetu, <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />tukalamula kumlaghila kwa mwenga mlongu wa twenga Timoseo, mweni ni mghola lihengu muyetu kukutangasa Habali Maha gha Sapanga. Tumyeghili ili awesi kuwagangamalisa na kuwataya moyu kuukwinila gha mwenga, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />lukani ukwinila wa mundu yoyosi paghati mwa mwenga ukotoho kusisila kwaikiva gha maghaso hagha. Mwenga mngumanya yiwa tungupalwa kupokela mahakilo. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Kwaikiva, patuwela pamonga na mwenga, tuwalongelili yiwa tutehakilwa, na handa vila mngumanya ndiwa ihumila vilavila. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Ndiwa kwaikiva nikamyegha Timoseo kwa mwenga. Nenga nilepelela kufumilila nesu, hinu nikamyegha Timoseo kwa mwenga ili mbati kupokela mighalu gha ukwinila wa mwenga. Nitilili ikotoho kuwela myesa kawayesa na lihengu lyogha tugholili paghati mwa mwenga liyaghamiki yaghiyaghi.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Ila Timoseo kahuya kala, na mweni katupegha ujumbi wa kutuhekelesa kwa ukwinila na upalo wa mwenga. Katulongela yiwa mngutukumbwiki machuwa yayendelela, na mvile na luhujulu lwa kutulola twenga handa twenga tuvile na luhujilu lwa kuwalola mwenga. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Hinu walongu wa twenga kumahakilo na maghaso hyogha tutaywa moyu kwaikiva gha ukwinila wa mwenga, <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Kwaikiva hinaa kwa uchakaka tunguhekelela kulama ikiva mwenga mtegholoka maha kwa Bambu. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Hinaa tunguwesa kumshukwile Sapanga kwaikiva gha mwenga. Tungumshukwile kwaikiva gha luheku litumema kuulongolu ghaki kwaikiva gha mwenga. <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Tunguyendelela kumyupa Sapanga uhiku na pamuhi kwa moyu wa twenga wogha ili atupatili njila gha kuwalola wuso kwa wuso na tuwesi kuwatanga chochosi kila kipungula kuukwinila wa mwenga.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Tungumyupa Sapanga, Tati wa twenga, na Bambu wa twenga Yesu atuyandalile njila gha twenga kuhika kwa mwenga. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Bambu awawesesi mwenga muyongesi kupalana na kuwapala wandu wogha nesu nesu, handa twenga vila tunguwapala mwenga. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Hinu ategangamalisa mioyu gha mwenga, na mwenga mtewela wandu mtimila na wambulete nesu kuulongolo gha Sapanga na Tati wa twenga lipindi Bambu wa twenga Yesu anguhika pamonga na wandu wogha wavile wa mweni.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s">Ngalilu imhekelesa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Mwihu wa hyogha walongu wa nenga, mjivula kuhuma kwa twenga vila mngupalwa kulikala ili kumghola Sapanga ahekeleli. Na chakaka muwela mngulikala nagha. Hinaa tunguwaluwa nesu kwa lihina lya Bambu Yesu muyendeleli kulikala nagha. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Kwaikiva mngumanya yala malaghililo tuwapeghili kwa ulongosi wa Bambu Yesu. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Sapanga angupala mwenga muweli wandu wa Sapanga na mlikali chonju na ungongola. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />Kila mlumi angupalwa ajivuli kulongosa higha ghaki kwa kuwela mundu wa Sapanga na utundamilu, <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />na ng'ogha kwa lumatamata mhakata handa wandu wammanya ng'ogha Sapanga. <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Hinu, mundu yoyosi akotoho kumgholela myaki uhakata hata kumlulunganya kwaikiva gha mghalu hau. Kwaikiva tuwalongelili kala hagha na kuwakanisa nesu yiwa Bambu atewahakila wala wogha wangughola mighalu hai. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Sapanga katukema ng'ogha tulikali kwa kughola ngongola, ila tulikali kwa umbuleti nesu. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Hinu, yula kangupughanya mavulo hagha kampughanya ng'ogha mundu, ila kangumpughanya Sapanga mweni yula kangutupegha Mpumulo ghaki Mmbuleti nesu.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Kwa kulongelelela upalo wa walongu ng'ogha lasima yeyosi kuwayandikila, kwaikiva mwenga weni mvulwa na Sapanga kila mmonga kumpala myaki. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Mwenga kwa uchakaka mnguwapala walongu wogha kummbwani wa Makedonia hyogha, ila walongu tunguwaluwa nesu myangilai kuwapala. <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Muweli na luhujulu lwa kulikala kwa kuponga, kila mmonga agholi mighalu ghaki mweni na agholi lihengu kwa mawoku ghaki mweni handa tuwalaghilili kula kuhyetu. <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />Ili kulikala kwa mwenga kwa kila lelu kuipatili utundamilu kuhuma kwa wandu wakilisito ng'ogha, na mtewela ng'ogha na lasima gha kuwalindila waghangi kwa vila mnguvihakula.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhika kwa Bambu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Walongu tungupala mmanyi uchakaka wa wala wawelili wahova kala, ili mkotoho kulumbilila handa wala waghangi wavile ng'ogha na litumaini. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Twenga tungukwinila yiwa Yesu ahovili, akahinduka, na hinu twenga tungukwinila yiwa Sapanga atewayegha pamonga na Yesu wala wogha wahovili wakiva wakimkwinila Yesu.<verse eid="1TH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Hali tunguwalongela ni mavulo gha Bambu, yiwa twenga twambila wakomu, wala tutevile tuhighala, Bambu paahika chakaka tutetumbula ng'ogha kuwalongola wala wahovili kala. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Kwaikiva Bambu mweni atehuluka kuhuma kundumba pamonga na lilowi lya lilaghilo, na lilowi lya mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga mkulu na lilowi lya lipembi lya Sapanga. Na ndiwa wala wahovili wakiva wangumkwinila Kilisito watehindulilwa mtumbulo. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Badili gha hali kuphita twenga tuvile wakomu lipindi hali tutekungulwa pamonga na weni kumahindu kukongine na Bambu kunani. Hinu tutewela pamonga na Bambu machuwa yayendelela. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Hinu, mpeghani moyu kwa milando hai.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s">Muliyandali kwa kuhika kwa Bambu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Walongu, lasima ng'ogha niwayandikili mghalu wowosi kuilongelelela lipindi au lisaa mighalu hai itehumila. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Kwaikiva mwenga maweni mngumanya chakaka lichuwa lya Bambu litehika handa mwihi vila anguhika uhiku. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Pala wandu wailongile, "Kila kindu ni luheku na kwahela makakala", ndiwa mayalamiso yatepowaguwila bwitu, hagha yatehumila bwitu handa utungu wa mlela pala umuhikila lipindi lya kujiwopola, kwahela mundu atewesa kuhyeta hali. <verse eid="1TH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Ila mwenga, walongu, mulwisa ng'ogha, lichuwa lila litewahikila ng'ogha bwitu handa vila anguhika mwihi. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Mwenga wogha ni wandu mngulikala kumhana, wandu wa pamuhi. Twenga wandu ng'ogha wa uhiku au wa mulwisa. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Hinu tukotoho kuwonja lughono handa waghangi, tungupalwa kulikala mihu uhiku wogha na tuliyandali. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Kwaikiva wogha wala wanguwonja uhiku, na wala wangulowela lipindi lya uhiku. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Ila twenga kwaikiva ni wandu wa pamuhi na tungupalwa kuliyandala kwa kuvala ukwinila na upalo handa nguu gha lyuma kulikingila mkitivi, na litumaini lyetu lya ulokola handa likokoma lya lyuma kulikingila. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Kwaikiva Sapanga katuhaghula ng'ogha ili tuyaghamili kwa lilaka lyaki, ila tuupokeli ulokola kwa kupitila Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito, <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />yula ahovili kwaikiva gha twenga, ili tupati kulikala pamonga na mweni, patuwela wakomu au patuhova kala. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Hinu mpeghani moyu na mtangani mwenga kwa mwenga, handa mghola hinaa.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghililo gha mwihu na lijambuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Walongu, tunguwaluwa muwatundamili wala wangughola lihengu paghati mwa mwenga, wala wanguwalongosa na kuwavula mlikali handa wandu wamkwinila Kilisito. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Muwapeghi utundamilu mkulunga na kuwapala kwaikiva gha lihengu wangulighola. Mlikali kwa kutowela na ngondu na paghati gha mwenga.<verse eid="1TH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Walongu tunguwaluwa nesu nesu muwakanisi wandu wala wapweli, muwatayi moyu wandu wala watenyuka moyu, muweli na kuwafumilila wandu wogha. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Mloli mundu yoyosi akotoho kumuhuyisila myaki mahakata kwa mahakata, ila machuwa hyogha mhakuli kugholelana hyogha yavili maha mwenga kwa mwenga na kwa wandu wogha.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Mhekeleli machuwa hyogha, <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />Myupi kila lipindi, <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />na kuwela na kushukwile kukila mghalu. Hagha ndiwa anguyapala Sapanga kwa kuhuma kwa mwenga mvile mkongana na Kilisito Yesu.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Mkotoho kumngingama Mpumulo wa Sapanga, <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />mkotoho kupughanya ulota wa Sapanga, <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />ila myesi kila kindu, myakoli yala yavili ghamaha. <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Na kuhyeta kila lila lihakata. <verse eid="1TH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Sapanga yula angutughola tulikali kwa kuwela ng'ogha na ngondu awaghulule mwenga nesu nesu kwa kila njila na kugholokela fwasi zya mwenga, mpumulo, mioyu, na mihigha gha mwenga kutali na lihakata lyoyosi lipindi lya kuhika kwaki Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Mweni yula kawakema mwenga ateghola nagha kwaikiva ni mweni angukwinilwa. <verse eid="1TH 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Walongu mtuyupili na twenga hilahila. <verse eid="1TH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Muwajambusi walongu wogha kwa kilangihi kya upalo. <verse eid="1TH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Ninguwalaghila kuulongolo gha Bambu mhighilisi yiwa walongu wogha wangusomelwa lihamba hai. <verse eid="1TH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Tunguwatakila manemu gha Bambu Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>